1. Gemini Web Bundle (included in `plugins/gemini-baton`)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Upstream Author: Andrew Li
- License: MIT License
- Local Adaptations:
  - Bundled as a self-contained runtime component inside `plugins/gemini-baton`.
