    triggers, and pending task recovery.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Image Analysis (`plugins/image-analysis`)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Upstream Project: neurogeom/copilotj (CopilotJ)
  https://github.com/neurogeom/copilotj
- License: Apache License, Version 2.0
- Local Adaptations:
  - Adapted for standalone MCP-only lifecycle operation (`http://127.0.0.1:3001/mcp`)
    and Jython script development/validation workflows.
  - Added dedicated Fiji instance ownership tracking via process PID and JVM
    token so shutdown routines only terminate Fiji processes started by the
    plugin after export completion.
  - Packaged with both prebuilt runtime JARs (two JARs) and the corresponding
    Java source code and Maven `pom.xml` under `plugins/image-analysis/source`,
    plus dual Codex plugin manifests (`.codex-plugin/plugin.json`, `plugin.json`,
    and `mcp.json`).

