3. DSH Baton (`plugins/dsh-baton`)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Upstream Project: JialaoLiu/dsh-baton (version 0.6.1)
  https://github.com/JialaoLiu/dsh-baton
- Upstream Author: Jialao Liu
- License: MIT License
- Local Adaptations:
  - Vendored from a local installation of `dsh-baton` 0.6.1 with all personal
    credentials, tokens, and runtime state removed.
  - Added dual Codex plugin manifests (`.codex-plugin/plugin.json`,
    `plugin.json`, and `mcp.json`), local MCP host/headless execution
    compatibility adjustments, and workhorse skill configuration defaults
    (`deepseek-flash` at `max` effort) paired with Gemini writing workflows.

